    {
      "id": "supply_reliability",
      "title": "Supply reliability of a river",
      "problem": "supply_reliability",
      "description": "Whether a river can supply a stated demand as a run-of-river abstraction: the fraction of days and years the flow, less an environmental reserve and capped at an abstraction share, meets it; from the gauge record, or from donor catchments as a band when there is no gauge.",
